BoomMine AttackWave R7 Leave
    Events
        Unit - A unit leaves BoomMineR21 <gen>
    Conditions
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Owner of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Player 1 (Red)
                (Owner of (Triggering unit)) Equal to Player 2 (Blue)
        (Number of units in (Units in BoomMineR21 <gen> owned by Player 1 (Red))) Equal to 0
        (Number of units in (Units in BoomMineR21 <gen> owned by Player 2 (Blue))) Equal to 0
    Actions
        -------- EVENT --------
        Custom script:   set bj_wantDestroyGroup = true
        Set VariableSet BoomMinePoint = (Center of BoomMineR21 <gen>)
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in (Units in BoomMineR21 <gen>) and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                            Conditions
                                (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Equal to Goblin Miner (Level 10)
                                (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Equal to Goblin Miner (Level 10 - No Wander)
                                (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Equal to Turret (Level 10)
                                (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Equal to Shredder (Level 14)
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Change ownership of (Picked unit) to Neutral Passive and Change color
                        Unit - Order (Picked unit) to Move To BoomMinePoint
                    Else - Actions
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BoomMinePoint)
